Γöé  ## ≡ƒÅù∩╕Å Testing Philosophy & Principles                                      Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Testing Pyramid Implementation**                                     Γöé
Γöé  ![alt text](../Diagrams/testing-strategy-pyramid.svg)                      Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Core Testing Principles**                                            Γöé
Γöé  1. **Arrange-Act-Assert (AAA) Pattern**: Clear test structure              Γöé
Γöé  2. **Test Independence**: Each test runs in isolation                      Γöé
Γöé  3. **Meaningful Names**: Tests describe what they verify                   Γöé
Γöé  4. **Fast Feedback**: Quick test execution for rapid development           Γöé
Γöé  5. **Maintainable Tests**: Easy to update when code changes                Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ---                                                                        Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ## ≡ƒö╖ Unit Testing Strategy                                                Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Purpose & Scope**                                                    Γöé
Γöé  Unit tests verify individual components in complete isolation using mocks  Γöé
Γöé  and test doubles.                                                          Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Testing Framework Stack**                                            Γöé
Γöé  ```csharp                                                                  Γöé
Γöé  // Core Testing Framework                                                  Γöé
Γöé  NUnit 3.13.3              // Test framework                                Γöé
Γöé  NUnit3TestAdapter 4.2.1   // Test runner                                   Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  // Mocking & Test Data                                                     Γöé
Γöé  Moq 4.18.4                 // Mocking framework                            Γöé
Γöé  AutoBogus 2.13.1          // Test data generation                          Γöé
Γöé  FluentAssertions 6.10.0   // Readable assertions                           Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  // Database Testing                                                        Γöé
Γöé  Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.InMemory 7.0.5  // In-memory database        Γöé
Γöé  ```                                                                        Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
