Γöé  ### **Controller Unit Testing**                                            Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **CitiesController Tests**                                            Γöé
Γöé  ```csharp                                                                  Γöé
Γöé  [TestFixture]                                                              Γöé
Γöé  public class CitiesControllerTests                                         Γöé
Γöé  {                                                                          Γöé
Γöé      private Mock<IApplicationDbContext> _mockContext;                      Γöé
Γöé      private Mock<ILogger<CitiesController>> _mockLogger;                   Γöé
Γöé      private CitiesController _controller;                                  Γöé
Γöé      private Mock<DbSet<City>> _mockCities;                                 Γöé
