Γöé  - Γ£à **Soft Delete Verification**: Deleted cities excluded from GET        Γöé
Γöé  requests                                                                   Γöé
Γöé  - Γ£à **Cascade Behavior**: Cities with weather data handling               Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **cURL Example**                                                      Γöé
Γöé  ```bash                                                                    Γöé
Γöé  curl -X DELETE "http://localhost:8080/api/cities/1"                        Γöé
