Γöé  ## ≡ƒôï Overview                                                             Γöé
Γöé  This document provides a comprehensive testing strategy for the            Γöé
Γöé  **AutomationPlayground API** designed specifically to help **manual        Γöé
Γöé  testers transition to automation testing**. The strategy covers multiple   Γöé
Γöé  testing levels, practical examples, and real-world scenarios using         Γöé
Γöé  **NUnit** testing framework.                                               Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ## ≡ƒÄ» Educational Purpose                                                  Γöé
Γöé  - **For Manual Testers**: Understand different types of automated testing  Γöé
Γöé  - **For Automation Engineers**: Learn comprehensive testing strategies     Γöé
Γöé  - **For QA Teams**: Bridge the gap between manual and automated testing    Γöé
Γöé  approaches                                                                 Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
