Γöé  ## ≡ƒö╢ Integration Testing Strategy                                         Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Purpose & Scope**                                                    Γöé
Γöé  Integration tests verify that multiple components work correctly           Γöé
Γöé  together, including database operations and API endpoints.                 Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
