Γöé  ### **Assertion Patterns**                                                 Γöé
Γöé  ```csharp                                                                  Γöé
Γöé  // Use FluentAssertions for readable tests                                 Γöé
Γöé  result.Should().NotBeNull();                                               Γöé
Γöé  result.Should().BeOfType<OkObjectResult>();                                Γöé
Γöé  response.StatusCode.Should().Be(HttpStatusCode.Created);                   Γöé
Γöé  cities.Should().HaveCount(3);                                              Γöé
Γöé  cities.Should().Contain(c => c.Name == "Cape Town");                       Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  // Test exceptions clearly                                                 Γöé
Γöé  var exception = await Assert.ThrowsAsync<ArgumentException>(               Γöé
Γöé      async () => await service.CreateInvalidCity());                        Γöé
Γöé  exception.Message.Should().Contain("Name is required");                    Γöé
Γöé  ```                                                                        Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Test Data Isolation**                                                Γöé
Γöé  ```csharp                                                                  Γöé
Γöé  [Test]                                                                     Γöé
Γöé  public async Task Should_IsolateTestData()                                 Γöé
Γöé  {                                                                          Γöé
Γöé      // Each test gets fresh database                                       Γöé
Γöé      using var context = new ApplicationDbContext(GetInMemoryDbOptions());  Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      // Arrange - Create test-specific data                                 Γöé
Γöé      var city = TestDataGenerator.CreateValidCity();                        Γöé
Γöé      context.Cities.Add(city);                                              Γöé
Γöé      await context.SaveChangesAsync();                                      Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      // Act & Assert - Test operates on isolated data                       Γöé
Γöé      var result = await context.Cities.FindAsync(city.Id);                  Γöé
Γöé      result.Should().NotBeNull();                                           Γöé
Γöé  }                                                                          Γöé
Γöé  ```                                                                        Γöé
