Γöé  ## ≡ƒº¬ API Testing Strategies                                               Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Manual Testing Approaches**                                          Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **1. Postman Collection Testing**                                     Γöé
Γöé  - **Tool**: Postman GUI                                                    Γöé
Γöé  - **Benefits**: Visual interface, easy request building                    Γöé
Γöé  - **Scenarios**: CRUD operations, validation testing, error handling       Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **2. Browser-Based Testing**                                          Γöé
Γöé  - **Tool**: Web browser for GET endpoints                                  Γöé
Γöé  - **Benefits**: Quick verification, visual response inspection             Γöé
Γöé  - **Scenarios**: Health checks, data retrieval endpoints                   Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **3. cURL Command Testing**                                           Γöé
Γöé  - **Tool**: Command line cURL                                              Γöé
Γöé  - **Benefits**: Scriptable, automation-ready                               Γöé
Γöé  - **Scenarios**: CI/CD integration, batch testing                          Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  ### **Automated Testing Approaches**                                       Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **1. Unit Testing (NUnit)**                                           Γöé
Γöé  ```csharp                                                                  Γöé
Γöé  [Test]                                                                     Γöé
Γöé  public async Task GetCities_Should_ReturnAllCities()                       Γöé
Γöé  {                                                                          Γöé
Γöé      // Arrange                                                             Γöé
Γöé      var client = _factory.CreateClient();                                  Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      // Act                                                                 Γöé
Γöé      var response = await client.GetAsync("/api/cities");                   Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      // Assert                                                              Γöé
Γöé      response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();                                    Γöé
Γöé      var content = await response.Content.ReadAsStringAsync();              Γöé
Γöé      var result = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<CitiesResponse>(content);      Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      Assert.That(result.Cities.Count, Is.GreaterThan(0));                   Γöé
Γöé      Assert.That(result.ServedBy, Is.Not.Null);                             Γöé
Γöé  }                                                                          Γöé
Γöé  ```                                                                        Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **2. Integration Testing**                                            Γöé
Γöé  ```csharp                                                                  Γöé
Γöé  [Test]                                                                     Γöé
Γöé  public async Task CreateCity_Should_PersistData()                          Γöé
Γöé  {                                                                          Γöé
Γöé      // Arrange                                                             Γöé
Γöé      var client = _factory.CreateClient();                                  Γöé
Γöé      var cityRequest = new { name = "Test City", country = "Test Country"   Γöé
Γöé  };                                                                         Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      // Act                                                                 Γöé
Γöé      var response = await client.PostAsJsonAsync("/api/cities",             Γöé
Γöé  cityRequest);                                                              Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      // Assert                                                              Γöé
Γöé      response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();                                    Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      // Verify persistence                                                  Γöé
Γöé      var getResponse = await client.GetAsync("/api/cities");                Γöé
Γöé      var cities = await                                                     Γöé
Γöé  getResponse.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<CitiesResponse>();                   Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé      Assert.That(cities.Cities.Any(c => c.Name == "Test City"), Is.True);   Γöé
Γöé  }                                                                          Γöé
Γöé  ```                                                                        Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
Γöé  #### **3. API Contract Testing**                                           Γöé
Γöé  - **Schema Validation**: Ensure response matches expected schema           Γöé
Γöé  - **Status Code Testing**: Verify appropriate HTTP status codes            Γöé
Γöé  - **Header Validation**: Check response headers and content types          Γöé
Γöé                                                                             Γöé
