Γöé  | Should return 200 OK, a list of all cities, and servedBy indicating      Γöé
Γöé  instance.                                                                  Γöé
Γöé  Rules: - Use Playwright request fixture, no external HTTP libs, and never  Γöé
Γöé  import request from @playwright/test - Build login payload keys EXACTLY    Γöé
Γöé  from LOGIN CONTRACT (for example use email when username_field=email) -    Γöé
Γöé  beforeAll: login to get token, set baseURL from process.env.BASE_URL -     Γöé
Γöé  AAA pattern: Arrange (create data via API), Act, Assert - Test each role   Γöé
Γöé  that should/shouldn't have access - expect() for status codes,             Γöé
Γöé  expect.soft() for body shape - For invalid-login scenarios, assert         Γöé
Γöé  unauthorized via `expect([400, 401]).toContain(response.status())`         Γöé
Γöé    and assert an error/message field exists in response body                Γöé
Γöé  - Always `await response.json()` before reading body properties - Use      Γöé
Γöé  credentials supplied in CREDENTIALS context for login tests, do not        Γöé
Γöé  invent users - Output ONE complete .spec.ts file - HARD LIMIT: maximum 2   Γöé
Γöé  test cases per endpoint ΓÇö pick the 2 highest priority (P0 first, then P1)  Γöé
